{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/2605433/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/2605433/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ごまバナナジュース！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"趣味合う子に出会うと高まるね。\n好きなブランドとか服の系統が\n同じ過ぎてびっくりしちゃった笑\n買い物行きたーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はなんだか前髪の調子が\n良かった気がしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週はずっと撮影してるー\n外で撮影してなんか楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/2605433/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかみんなからだ張ってます。\n今回は全体的にダンスが激しいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服と新衣装かわいいよ！\nお楽しみだねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏みたいに暑いね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/2605433/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗っかきの私はもうどろどろに\nなってしまいそうよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張るー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/2605433/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}